msgstr "[ OK ]"

msgid "[ TODO ]"
msgstr "[ A FAIRE ]"

msgid "desktop entry (« Play GAMMA (direct) »)"
msgstr "entrée bureau (« Jouer à GAMMA (direct) »)"

msgid "desktop entry (« GAMMA Linux Launcher »)"
msgstr "entrée bureau (« Lanceur GAMMA (Linux) »)"

msgid "application icon"
msgstr "icône de l'application"

msgid "launcher icon"
msgstr "icône du launcher"

msgid "`stalker-gamma-linux` command"
msgstr "commande `stalker-gamma-linux`"

msgid "`stalker-gamma-linux-gui` command"
msgstr "commande `stalker-gamma-linux-gui`"

msgid "settings and install state"
msgstr "réglages et état d'installation"

msgid "logs"
msgstr "journaux"

msgid "game data (Anomaly, mods, cache, Proton prefix)"
msgstr "données de jeu (Anomaly, mods, cache, préfixe Proton)"

msgid "The following will be removed:"
msgstr "Les éléments suivants vont être retirés :"

msgid "Nothing to remove — already clean."
msgstr "Rien à retirer — déjà propre."

msgid "Removed:"
msgstr "Retiré :"

msgid "Dry run — nothing will be deleted."
msgstr "Simulation — rien ne sera supprimé."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Game data was kept: {root}\n"
"Remove it with `--game-data`, or delete that directory by hand."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Les données de jeu ont été conservées : {root}\n"
"Supprime-les avec `--game-data`, ou efface ce répertoire à la main."

msgid ""
"\n"
"The Python environment itself (~/.local/share/stalker-gamma-linux/venv) "
"is still there — this command runs from it. Remove it with:\n"
"  rm -rf ~/.local/share/stalker-gamma-linux"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"L'environnement Python lui-même (~/.local/share/stalker-gamma-linux/venv)"
" est toujours là — cette commande tourne depuis lui. Retire-le avec :\n"
"  rm -rf ~/.local/share/stalker-gamma-linux"

msgid "Play GAMMA (direct)"
msgstr "Jouer à GAMMA (direct)"

msgid ""
"Launches G.A.M.M.A directly (Anomaly + MO2 under Proton), bypassing the "
"launcher"
msgstr ""
"Lance directement G.A.M.M.A. (Anomaly + MO2 sous Proton), sans passer par"
" le launcher"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Could not write {path}: {cause}"
msgstr "Impossible d'écrire {path} : {cause}"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Error: {error}"
msgstr "Erreur : {error}"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Desktop shortcut created/updated: {desktop_file}\n"
"It shows up in your desktop environment's application menu.\n"
"\n"
"To also add it to Steam (useful for Steam Input or Gaming Mode on the "
"Steam Deck): Steam → Add a Game → Add a Non-Steam Game → Browse, select:"
"\n"
"  {executable}\n"
"then, in that Steam entry's properties, set the launch options to:\n"
"  {launch_options}\n"
"Steam then handles the artwork and compat tool choice itself."
msgstr ""
"Raccourci bureau créé/actualisé : {desktop_file}\n"
"Il apparaît dans le menu applications de ton environnement de bureau.\n"
"\n"
"Pour l'ajouter aussi à Steam (utile pour Steam Input ou le mode Gaming "
"sur Steam Deck) : Steam → Ajouter un jeu → Ajouter un jeu non-Steam → "
"Parcourir, sélectionne :\n"
"  {executable}\n"
"puis, dans les propriétés de cette entrée Steam, mets en options de "
"lancement :\n"
"  {launch_options}\n"
"Steam gère alors l'artwork et le choix du compat tool lui-même."

msgid ""
"Dead ModDB mirror upstream (gamma-launcher issue #167). Update gamma-"
"launcher to the latest release and retry: the already-downloaded cache is"
" kept."
msgstr ""
"Miroir ModDB mort côté amont (issue #167 de gamma-launcher). Mets à jour "
"gamma-launcher vers la dernière release puis relance : le cache déjà "
"téléchargé est conservé."

msgid ""
"Known issue with the release binary on some distributions. Retry with "
"`LD_PRELOAD=/usr/lib/libreadline.so`, or install gamma-launcher via pip "
"in a venv instead of the standalone binary."
msgstr ""
"Erreur connue avec le binaire de release sur certaines distributions. "
"Relance avec `LD_PRELOAD=/usr/lib/libreadline.so`, ou installe gamma-"
"launcher via pip dans un venv plutôt que le binaire autonome."

msgid ""
"libunrar is missing. Install it (see `stalker-gamma-linux doctor` for the"
" command for your distribution) and retry."
msgstr ""
"libunrar est absente. Installe-la (voir `stalker-gamma-linux doctor` pour"
" la commande adaptée à ta distribution) puis relance."

msgid ""
"gamma-launcher not found in PATH. Install it in the same environment as "
"stalker-gamma-linux, for example: pip install 'gamma-launcher @ "
"git+https://github.com/Mord3rca/gamma-launcher.git@v3.1'"
msgstr ""
"gamma-launcher introuvable dans le PATH. Installe-le dans le même "
"environnement que stalker-gamma-linux, par exemple : pip install 'gamma-"
"launcher @ git+https://github.com/Mord3rca/gamma-launcher.git@v3.1'"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "gamma-launcher {subcommand} cancelled."
msgstr "gamma-launcher {subcommand} annulé."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"gamma-launcher {subcommand} failed (code {code}).\n"
"Last output lines:\n"
"{tail}"
msgstr ""
"gamma-launcher {subcommand} a échoué (code {code}).\n"
"Dernières lignes de sortie :\n"
"{tail}"

msgid ""
"Retry the same command: the cache already downloaded and verified is not "
"re-downloaded."
msgstr ""
"Relance la même commande : le cache déjà téléchargé et vérifié n'est pas "
"retéléchargé."

